kata hussain ka sar fauje haq tamam huwi<br>
<br>
1. kata ke shano ko shabbir ke baradar ne<br>
wafa ko di hai baqa karbala ke hyder ne<br>
bujhe charaag-e-ali bekaso ki shaam huwi<br>
<br>
2. dilo ko fatha kiya tune istarha asghar<br>
jo waar tune kiya jis se ro pada lashkar<br>
tere labon ki hasi teg be niyam huwi<br>
<br>
3. rahi na fauj na sardar na alambardar<br>
phiraya jayega itrat ko ab sar-e-bazaar<br>
ilahi dasht-e-bala yeh kaisi shaam huwi<br>
<br>
4. tabahi qaimo mein aayi rahi na koi paas<br>
mila hai zainab e muztar ko mansabe abbas<br>
sahara ahle haram ka bani jo shaam huwi<br>
<br>
5. jale qayaam to zainab ne badke di yeh sada<br>
nahi hai koi muhafiz meri chini hai rida<br>
talaya karti thi zainab jo ban mei shaam huwi<br>
<br>
6. woh nok-e-naiza se quraan pad rahe hai hussain<br>
yeh shahzadiya ro ro ke kar rahi hai bain<br>
yeh shahre shaam mein kaisi bala ki shaam huwi<br>
<br>
7. tamam ranjo masayeb ko seh gayi bibi<br>
sar-e-hussain pe sar rakh ke so gayi bibi<br>
main kya bataun ke zindan mein kaisi shaam huwi<br>
<br>
